<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysian Resources buys more NSTP shares.</title>
<headline>Malaysian Resources buys more NSTP shares.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian Resources Corp Bhd (MRCB) said on Saturday it had bought an additional 1.206 million shares in publishing group New Straits Times Press (Malaysia) Bhd (NSTP) from the open market.</p>
<p>The shares were acquired between April 14 and 21 at prices ranging from 14.70 to 15.00 ringgit a share, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Following the acquisition, MRCB, a diversified conglomerate, now holds 89.771 million shares or 45.26 percent interest in NSTP, the statement said.</p>
<p>NSTP stock closed at 14.30 ringgit on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
